<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield close scores on Saturday (second day of four):</p>
<p>Brisbane: Victoria 162 (Andrew Bichel 5-46) and 54-0. Queensland 305 (Andrew Symonds 77).</p>
<p>Hobart: New South Wales 403-9 dec (Brad McNamara 137 not out). Tasmania 148-3.</p>
<p>Adelaide: South Australia 277 and 27-1. Western Australia 318 (Justin Langer 116, Damien Martyn 96).</p>
</text>
